  "instance_name": "transatlantic_slave_trade",
  "label": "Transatlantic Slave Trade",
  "description": "A historical system of forced migration and enslavement of Africans across the Atlantic Ocean, primarily by European colonial powers from the 16th to 19th centuries. This event is central to understanding the visual scene as it depicts the commodification and dehumanization of Black people. The meme uses this horrific historical event to create a hateful analogy with modern consumerism, equating the sale of human beings with Black Friday sales.",
